OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham among Great North Run
OL,4,Afinishers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 13.1-mile (21km) event saw runners
OL,7,Fand wheelchair users race from
OL,8,FNewcastle through Gateshead and South
OL,9,FTyneside, before finishing in South
OL,10,FShields.
OL,12,FBritons David Weir and Melanie Woods
OL,13,Fwon the men's and women's elite
OL,14,Fwheelchair races respectively. Brigid
OL,15,FKosgei won the elite women's contest
OL,16,Fand Zouhair Talbi won the men's race.
